TYPES: #eg-0306 game, videogame, alternate-reality-game

PRE-MARKUP:

Example of an Alternate Reality Game (ARG).

MICRODATA:

HTML
<div itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Game">
  <h1 itemprop="name">I Love Bees</h1>

  <p itemprop="description">
    A scary Alternate Reality Game (ARG). Boo!
  </p>

  <link itemprop="sameAs"
        href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Love_Bees">

  <span itemprop="author">Author name</span>
  <span itemprop="award">Award name</span>

  <div itemprop="gameLocation"
       itemscope
       itemtype="https://schema.org/Place">
    <span itemprop="name">United States</span>
  </div>

  <meta itemprop="datePublished" content="2004-08-11">

  <a itemprop="discussionUrl"
     href="https://example.com/discussion">
    Discussion
  </a>

  <span itemprop="alternativeHeadline">A Title</span>

  <img itemprop="image"
       src="https://example.com/image.jpg"
       alt="I Love Bees">

  <div itemprop="isBasedOn"
       itemscope
       itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork">
    <span itemprop="name">Original source work</span>
  </div>

  <a itemprop="url" href="https://example.com">
    Official website
  </a>

  <span itemprop="publisher">Publisher name</span>
</div>


